              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esaya 19:1-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Esek 29:1—32:32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palwa calo ca Egupto, Yawe alandile pa mulandu wa fita fyakwa Farao Neko, imfumu ya calo ca Egupto, ifyo Nebukadinesa imfumu ya ku Babiloni acimfishe ku Kakemishi, mupepi no mumana wa Yufurate, mu mwaka walengele ine apo Yehoyakimu mwana Yosia atampile ukulateeka icalo ca Yuda. Atile ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
